  (text "J4: OC1 | OC2 | +5V | GND, pulse 1 -> GPIO5, pulse 2 -> GPIO6\nopen collector / contact / 3.3-24 V logic, up to VIN (36 V TVS, 10k series, 5.6 V zener)\n74LVC2G14 inverts: pulse = HIGH; JP11 / JP12 on = low-pass\nJP10: 1-2 = powered in deep sleep, 2-3 = switched\nJP16: OC1 1/3/5, OC2 2/4/6; 1-3 = pull-up, 3-5 = pull-down (PNP)"
